window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Ace is apparently killed and her dead Nan appears to help her cross over to 'the other side'. Faced with her own internal demons, how long can she cling to life? And what is 'the other side'? The final track of this download is a 10-minute edition discussion with Bill Baggs and Sophie Aldred, Editor Alistair Lock and Assistant Producer John Ainsworth. </p><p>With Sophie Aldred as Ace, Sylvester McCoy as The Professor, Barbara Shelley as Ace's Nan, Jane Burke as Nadia, Jack Galagher as the Paramedic, other voices by John Ainsworth and Alistair Lock. Sound Engineer: Alistair Lock, Post Production: Nick Briggs Music: Harvey Summers, Asst. Prod. John Ainsworth Produced and Directed by Bill Baggs.</p><p><b>A full-cast audio drama.</b></p>"; 
